{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Security Vulnerability.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Security Vulnerability.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai security vulnerability ai security vulnerability","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Security Vulnerability.md","fileName":"AI Security Vulnerability.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Security Vulnerability","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Data Ethics and Digital Power]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and Digital Power","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Security Vulnerability.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Security Vulnerability.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai security vulnerability ai security vulnerability","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Security Vulnerability.md","fileName":"AI Security Vulnerability.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Security Vulnerability","heading":"AI Security Vulnerability","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An AI security vulnerability is a weakness that allows data, a model, or a connected system to be manipulated, exposed, or made unavailable. The resulting harm depends on where the AI is embedded: compromise of entertainment recommendations differs from compromise of transport, health, energy, or military infrastructure.\n\nSecurity is therefore an ethical requirement as well as a technical property. As institutions delegate more activity to networked systems, attacks and failures can threaten safety, privacy, and access to essential services. Risk assessment must include the people who depend on the system and the unequal ability of groups to recover from disruption.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and Digital Power","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageS